---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'July 26, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | SafeScreen"
  description="What SafeScreen collects, what it never collects, and how to reach us. Written in plain English."
>
  <section class="container-tight pt-20 pb-4 sm:pt-28">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-[2.4rem] font-bold leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-5xl">
      Plain English, because you should actually read this one.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-fg-3">Last updated: {updated}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-tight mt-12">
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-12">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl">This website</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-2">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">What we collect:</strong> if you join the waitlist, we collect one
            thing: the email address you type in. That's the only form on this site.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">What we do with it:</strong> we store it so we can email you when
            SafeScreen launches. Waitlist emails are stored with our email provider (Resend) and on our
            hosting provider (Cloudflare). We don't sell it, share it, or add you to anything else.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">What we don't do:</strong> this site sets no tracking cookies and runs
            no third-party analytics. Fonts are served from our own domain, so your visit isn't disclosed
            to a fonts CDN. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) processes standard server logs to serve the
            site, as every host does.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">Want off the list?</strong> Email
            <a href="mailto:info@mysafescreen.com" class="link-accent">info@mysafescreen.com</a> and we'll
            delete your address.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl">The SafeScreen app</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-2">
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">Your screen stays on your phone.</strong> The AI that checks your
            screen runs entirely on your device. Frames are analyzed on the spot and immediately
            discarded. Your screen content is never uploaded, stored, or tied to your account.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">Your account holds the minimum.</strong> Signing up takes an email
            address, and that's all the account ever holds. No browsing history, no activity feed, no
            record of what was blurred.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">No tracking, no ads.</strong> We don't build a profile of you, and we
            have nothing to sell to advertisers.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong class="text-fg">SafeScreen never reports or deletes anything.</strong> It blurs, it
            labels, and it leaves every decision to reveal with you.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl">Changes and contact</h2>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-2">
          <p>
            If this policy changes, we'll update this page and the date at the top. Questions, deletion
            requests, anything else:
            <a href="mailto:info@mysafescreen.com" class="link-accent">info@mysafescreen.com</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
